{"title":"2025 IOQM/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Problem_Statement_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.B6.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.A8.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.A3.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_Statement_പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Three sides of a quadrilateral are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/1/e3135959eef0b596181292a855be89e4825c8bbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a= 4\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15cc8804d5482ae978d97e7912aa9c768329ad49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=9$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/5/f55c826aaa5d2ddfd0693f9884c53283f79dfec4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c= \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"21\" />. The sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> enclose an angle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/919bf5d461970fc8d905d63704ef763c08594184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30^\\circ$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />, and the sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> enclose an angle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/e/22ec0d2e4202839322d26a23dcb13f79821df5d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" />. If the acute angles between the diagonals is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/6/7a66181795ab222ad9ff38cb534dead38e5a47de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" />, what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p>ഒരു ചതുർഭുജത്തിന്റെ മൂന്ന് വശങ്ങൾ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/1/e3135959eef0b596181292a855be89e4825c8bbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a= 4\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15cc8804d5482ae978d97e7912aa9c768329ad49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=9$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, കൂടാതെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/5/f55c826aaa5d2ddfd0693f9884c53283f79dfec4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c= \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"21\" /> ആണ്. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />യും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />യും തമ്മിൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/919bf5d461970fc8d905d63704ef763c08594184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30^\\circ$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> കോണും, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />യും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />യും തമ്മിൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/e/22ec0d2e4202839322d26a23dcb13f79821df5d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> കോണും ഉൾക്കൊള്ളുന്നു. വികർണ്ണങ്ങൾ തമ്മിലുള്ള ന്യൂനകോണം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/6/7a66181795ab222ad9ff38cb534dead38e5a47de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> ആണെങ്കിൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> എത്രയാണ്?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B9.E0.B4.BE.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_പരിഹാരം\">Solution പരിഹാരം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution പരിഹാരം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:P12-2025IOQM.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/0/0f/P12-2025IOQM.png/450px-P12-2025IOQM.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"220\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/0/0f/P12-2025IOQM.png/675px-P12-2025IOQM.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/0/0f/P12-2025IOQM.png/900px-P12-2025IOQM.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> intersect the altitude from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and the altitude from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> intersect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/2/d429b141d2b0169fc300b86e2a54b9347543ad40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEF \\sim \\triangle ABC$\" width=\"141\" height=\"13\" /> thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/561e6a5fc47fe955e66a04e9fb3c8fd461f48083.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{x} = \\frac{9}{\\sqrt{3}} \\implies x = \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"190\" height=\"48\" />. Regardless, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/5/975e3ad4886e2dc7af4eb3ddba8fabfdd8dc6c5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE = 2\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"21\" />. Notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/7/2274c52a166de0a04e4b35666468a07ccbcf63d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADE = 60^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/9/809de16f02e990f8ea0a1b9ae924510af0c63757.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(\\angle EDB) = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"150\" height=\"43\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a48575a38bab84dc49e531fb7b8f0f459542d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EDB = 30^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" /> as the quadrilateral is convex.\n</p><p>Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/8/fe832af47de93bf6ef1d09f48a49c90c81500bf7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADP$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/1/5f11d4b6625f16c45f0000770fffe8acd6de2449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = AC \\cap DB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"119\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/e/22ec0d2e4202839322d26a23dcb13f79821df5d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" />. Thus one can degenerate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> onto <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is the new diagonal of the quadrilateral and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/1/8810a26f59e2c67b5f2ff052a7e2a294fef0a03e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADB$\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> is the enclosing triangle, and notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/99598c292ca0534c8b5d6e3703e40cb43edfd439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DAB = 30^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/e/ade5f7dd0aa1a10c274e35a6815535debc85ff02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADB = 90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />, thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/1/4a14652290672c9563261891fa938ea0c00c7055.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DBA = \\boxed{60^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"120\" height=\"26\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> എന്നത് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> ൽ നിന്നുള്ള ലംബത്തെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />-ൽ വിഭജിക്കുകയും, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> ൽ നിന്നുള്ള ലംബം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />-യെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />-ൽ വിഭജിക്കുകയും ചെയ്യട്ടെ. അപ്പോൾ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/2/d429b141d2b0169fc300b86e2a54b9347543ad40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEF \\sim \\triangle ABC$\" width=\"141\" height=\"13\" />, അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/561e6a5fc47fe955e66a04e9fb3c8fd461f48083.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{x} = \\frac{9}{\\sqrt{3}} \\implies x = \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"190\" height=\"48\" />. എന്തായാലും, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/5/975e3ad4886e2dc7af4eb3ddba8fabfdd8dc6c5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE = 2\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"21\" /> ആണ്. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/7/2274c52a166de0a04e4b35666468a07ccbcf63d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADE = 60^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" /> എന്നും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/9/809de16f02e990f8ea0a1b9ae924510af0c63757.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(\\angle EDB) = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"150\" height=\"43\" /> എന്നും ശ്രദ്ധിക്കുക. അതിനാൽ, ചതുർഭുജം convex ആയതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a48575a38bab84dc49e531fb7b8f0f459542d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EDB = 30^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>അപ്പോൾ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/1/5f11d4b6625f16c45f0000770fffe8acd6de2449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = AC \\cap DB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"119\" height=\"14\" /> ആയിരിക്കെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/9/3f9e779e9e8ebab69c8f511c3657a69096061391.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADP = 90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" /> ആണ്. അതിനാൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />-യെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />-യിലേക്ക് ചുരുക്കി <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />-യെ ചതുർഭുജത്തിന്റെ പുതിയ വികർണ്ണമായും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/1/8810a26f59e2c67b5f2ff052a7e2a294fef0a03e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADB$\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />-യെ ഉൾക്കൊള്ളുന്ന ത്രികോണമായും പരിഗണിക്കാം. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/99598c292ca0534c8b5d6e3703e40cb43edfd439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DAB = 30^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" /> എന്നും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/e/ade5f7dd0aa1a10c274e35a6815535debc85ff02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADB = 90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" /> എന്നും ശ്രദ്ധിക്കുക. അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/1/4a14652290672c9563261891fa938ea0c00c7055.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DBA = \\boxed{60^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"120\" height=\"26\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070502\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 244/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11548/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37890:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018070502 and revision id 292628. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}